* Perform a CMS370 CREXX build of the disassembler
&ERROR &EXIT &RETCODE

&DEBUG = &1
&SRCDISK = &2
&BINDISK = &3
&PARMFN = CREXX&DEBUG

EXEC CRXGCC RXDAMAIN C &SRCDISK ( CMS PARM &PARMFN CSECT
EXEC CRXGCC RXDADISM C &SRCDISK ( CMS PARM &PARMFN CSECT

GLOBAL TXTLIB AVL_TREE CMSLIB PLATFORM GCCLIB
LOAD RXDAMAI@ RXDADIS@ CMSUTIL@ PLATFOR@ ( CLEAR NOAUTO RESET @@MAIN
GENMOD RXDAS&DEBUG ( FROM RXDAMAI@
&TYPE RXDAS&DEBUG -V
RXDAS&DEBUG -V
COPY RXDAS&DEBUG MODULE A = = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
COPY LOAD MAP A RXDAS&DEBUG = &BINDISK ( OLDDATE REPLACE
ERASE RXDAS&DEBUG MODULE A
ERASE LOAD MAP A
ERASE * TEXT A

&EXIT 0
